    "midnightTitle": "At 00:00, three things happen.",
    "midnightP": "The rotation is a small, ordered routine. It runs every day in <strong>Europe/Paris</strong>, and the order matters: the new day's slot is cleared before anything is written to it.",
    "step1Title": "Clear the incoming slot",
