    "rulesSmall": "Retention is fixed in this guide at 7 days + today. If the service configuration changes, update the page constant and this section together.",
    "scheduleTitle": "The next nine midnights.",
    "scheduleP": "For the selected scenario, this is the full nine-day cycle. The first row is the next 00:00 after the selected day. The incoming day takes one slot; the oldest retained day falls out of the window and becomes empty.",
    "scheduleTh1": "00:00 on",
    "scheduleTh2": "New day uses",
