    "techFormulaTitle": "Slot formula",
    "techFormulaP": "<code>slot = ((day − 2000-01-01) mod 9 + 9) mod 9</code>. The day is a calendar day; date arithmetic is done on UTC date-only values, while “today” is resolved in <code>Europe/Paris</code>.",
    "techRetentionTitle": "Retention",
    "techRetentionP": "<code>retention = 7</code>. “In use” means today plus the 7 retention days, so 8 slots hold data and 1 is empty. Empty slots = 9 − live slots.",
    "techRotationTitle": "Rotation",
